    "逐次测量": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einzelmessungen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Each reading"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada medición"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chaque mesure"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"測定ごと"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"개별 측정"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada medição"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Каждое измерение"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"逐次测量"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"逐次測量"}}}},
    "通信协议": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kommunikationsprotokolle"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Communication protocols"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protocolos de comunicación"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protocoles de communication"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通信プロトコル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"통신 프로토콜"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protocolos de comunicação"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Протоколы связи"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通信协议"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通訊協定"}}}},
    "配置和数据文件": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konfigurations- und Datendatei"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configuration and Data File"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivo de configuración y datos"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fichier de configuration et de données"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定とデータのファイル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정 및 데이터 파일"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ficheiro de configuração e dados"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Файл конфигурации и данных"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置和数据文件"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定和資料檔案"}}}},
    "配置和数据文件格式无效": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ungültiges Format der Konfigurations- und Datendatei"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Invalid configuration and data file format"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El formato del archivo de configuración y datos no es válido"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Format du fichier de configuration et de données non valide"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定とデータのファイル形式が無効です"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정 및 데이터 파일 형식이 올바르지 않습니다"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O formato do ficheiro de configuração e dados é inválido"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Недопустимый формат файла конфигурации и данных"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置和数据文件格式无效"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定和資料檔案格式無效"}}}},
    "配置将替换本机配置，并把文件中的 %lld 条记录与本机记录合并。重复记录不会重复保存。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Konfiguration ersetzt die lokale Konfiguration. %lld Datensätze aus der Datei werden mit den lokalen Datensätzen zusammengeführt. Duplikate werden nicht erneut gespeichert."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The configuration will replace the local configuration, and %lld records from the file will be merged with local records. Duplicates will not be saved again."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La configuración sustituirá la configuración local y se combinarán %lld registros del archivo con los registros locales. Los duplicados no se guardarán de nuevo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La configuration remplacera la configuration locale et %lld mesures du fichier seront fusionnées avec les mesures locales. Les doublons ne seront pas enregistrés à nouveau."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定は端末の設定を置き換え、ファイル内の%lld件の記録を端末の記録と結合します。重複する記録は保存されません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정은 기기의 설정을 대체하고 파일의 기록 %lld개를 기기의 기록과 병합합니다. 중복 기록은 다시 저장되지 않습니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A configuração substituirá a configuração local e serão combinados %lld registos do ficheiro com os registos locais. Os duplicados não serão guardados novamente."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Конфигурация заменит локальную, а %lld записей из файла будут объединены с локальными записями. Дубликаты не будут сохранены повторно."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置将替换本机配置，并把文件中的 %lld 条记录与本机记录合并。重复记录不会重复保存。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定將取代本機設定，並把檔案中的 %lld 筆記錄與本機記錄合併。重複記錄不會重複儲存。"}}}},
    "配置文件": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konfigurationsdatei"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configuration File"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivo de configuración"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fichier de configuration"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定ファイル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정 파일"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ficheiro de configuração"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Файл конфигурации"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置文件"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定檔案"}}}},
